    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "048b526f70f719ee",
      "translationZh": "3.49M tokens 是整个会话中所有轮次和工具交互累计的 token 用量，而不是当前活跃上下文窗口的大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8570fc37cbbb64b1",
      "translationZh": "这基本上就是一次性给出提示词，然后让 Pi Agent 长时间自主运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db3cc427bf4e3cad",
      "translationZh": "1 条用户消息 → 72 轮助手回复 → 71 次工具调用 → 112k 个生成的 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c97eda6017015374",
      "translationZh": "整个过程的推理强度都设为 Low，并通过基于全新的 qwen4exp PR 自定义编译的 llama.cpp 构建版本，在本地运行 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
